                                "sense_id": "c0fa024b-2b59-326c-988a-362d8e4ecebc",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: reportedly, purportedly, putatively, rumoredly, supposedly, allegedly, ostensibly, possibly, probably, likely, plausibly"
